WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.547
Day 4. More and Less.

2
00:00:01.997 --> 00:00:09.998
Watch first. Show it with real things. The first one on the page is done for you. Then do one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.498 --> 00:00:14.944
Make two rows of real things, five and three, one under the other, lined up.

4
00:00:15.444 --> 00:00:19.964
Ask: which row has more? Your child points to the things that have no partner.

5
00:00:20.564 --> 00:00:24.019
Lining them up shows it without counting. Then count to check.

6
00:00:24.619 --> 00:00:30.356
Now add one more to the short row. Ask: how many now? One more is always the next number.

7
00:00:31.056 --> 00:00:34.276
Job one: count each group, and circle the group with more.

8
00:00:34.726 --> 00:00:37.854
Job two: count, draw one more, and write how many now.
